    "introduction": "Computacenter helps large organisations select, obtain, install and operate technology. Its customers include businesses and public-sector bodies that need devices, data-centre infrastructure, networks and related services. Revenue comes from technology sourcing, professional projects and ongoing managed services, combining product transactions with longer-term support relationships. It works with major technology vendors while helping customers integrate equipment and software into their own environments. The business depends on procurement capability, technical staff and reliable service delivery. Customer investment budgets affect product and project activity, while managed services create recurring work. Large contracts and the mix of hardware and services can influence margins and cash flow.",
